<title>UK: MILLENNIUM &amp; COPTHORNE UP AHEAD OF RESULTS.</title>
<headline>MILLENNIUM &amp; COPTHORNE UP AHEAD OF RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in UK-based hotel company Millennium &amp; Copthorne Hotels Plc rose five percent on Tuesday ahead of interim results due on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Analysts said the appreciation was a clear indication that strong figures were expected although they noted that volume was thin at little over 140,000 shares. The stock was 17.5p firmer at 367.5p at 1510 GMT.</p>
